        <summary ToolPath="TrimmedButTooLong" tool="FirstSentenceInJavadocToMdoc">
          <para>Open flag: Flag for openDatabase(File, OpenParams) to open the database for reading only. This is the only reliable way to open a database if the disk may be full.</para>
