        <summary ToolPath="Untrimmed" tool="FirstSentenceInJavadocToMdoc">
          <para>Open flag: Flag for openDatabase(File, OpenParams) to open the database for reading and writing. If the disk is full, this may fail even before you actually write anything.</para>
          <para>Note that the value of this flag is 0, so it is the default.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/database/sqlite/SQLiteDatabase#OPEN_READWRITE" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.database.sqlite.SQLiteDatabase.OPEN_READWRITE</code>.</a></format></para>
